PIX Billing Stack — Project Conventions

- All monetary values in Cents (int), never float.
- All I/O functions must be async.
- Pydantic v2 models for all API shapes.
- No bare except clauses — catch specific exceptions.
- Every public function needs a docstring.
- HMAC-SHA256 for all webhook signatures.
- Encrypt PII fields at rest using src/core/crypto.py.
- Never log raw CPF, CNPJ, or email — always masked.
- Import from src.core.* freely, never modify it.
- Test file for every new module before considering it done.
- Layered architecture: API → Service → Repository → Core. No cross-layer imports.
- Strict typing: mypy strict, Pydantic v2, no `Any`.
- All DB writes transactional. Idempotency keys on charge creation.
- Soft deletes only — add `deleted_at` instead of DELETE FROM.
- English everywhere — code, comments, commits, docs.
